WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.112
Welcome to the Blue Team Scribe orientation.

00:00:03.112 --> 00:00:06.700
Own Blue Team's written decision record, preserve its rationale

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.075
, and hand complete work across the explicit review boundary

00:00:10.075 --> 00:00:10.238
.

00:00:10.238 --> 00:00:13.350
Your workflow moves from listening, to structured drafting,

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.125
to an explicit handoff.

00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:18.550
Use each surface to preserve the team’s intent, evidence

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.837
, assumptions, and rationale.

00:00:20.837 --> 00:00:23.725
A record is not handed off merely because another role

00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:24.675
can see it;

00:00:24.675 --> 00:00:28.025
confirm the documented workflow state before you move on.
